A punch to the body that deals [141%, 154%, 164%, 172%, 180% (TL1-5)] damage, drains [2, 4, 6, 8, 10 (TL1-5)] of the target's stamina per combo point, and dazes the target for [1, 1, 1, 2, 2 (TL1-5)] to [2, 3, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns, depending on the amount of combo points you've accumulated.

The daze chance will increase with your Physical Power.

Using this talent removes your combo points.
